- description: This metric evaluates the effectiveness of data refresh processes by comparing actual refresh times against established Service Level Agreements (SLAs). It specifically measures the frequency and punctuality of updates to dashboards, ensuring that users have access to the most current data for decision-making. By flagging dashboards that exhibit stale or lagging updates, this metric highlights potential issues in data governance and operational efficiency. The scope of this metric encompasses all dashboards within the BI environment, focusing on their ability to deliver timely insights. Ultimately, it serves as a critical indicator of the reliability and responsiveness of the BI system in supporting business intelligence needs.

