Metric:
- id: features.cross_links
- name: 
- description: This metric evaluates the extent of cross-linking between dashboards and reports within the Business Intelligence ecosystem. A higher number of cross-links indicates a stronger integration of insights, facilitating a more cohesive understanding of data across different analytical views. It measures how well different reports and dashboards are interconnected, allowing users to navigate seamlessly between related insights. This integration is crucial for decision support, as it enables users to draw comprehensive conclusions from multiple data sources. The scope of this metric includes all dashboards and reports within the BI platform, focusing on the relational dynamics that enhance user engagement and insight discovery.

