- description: This metric measures the trend of weekly active users engaging with the Business Intelligence platform over a specified time period. It provides insights into user adoption by tracking the number of unique users who interact with BI tools at least once during the week. By analyzing this trend, organizations can identify patterns of growth or decline in user engagement, which is critical for assessing the effectiveness of BI initiatives. The metric helps stakeholders understand whether users are consistently leveraging BI resources for decision-making or if there are barriers to usage that need to be addressed. Additionally, it serves as a key indicator of the overall health of the BI ecosystem within the organization.

