- description: The Export Frequency Rate measures how often users export data or reports from the Business Intelligence platform in various formats such as CSV, PPT, and PDF. A high export rate may suggest that users are seeking to utilize data outside the application, potentially indicating limitations in the in-app usability or functionality. This metric provides insights into user engagement and satisfaction, as frequent exports may reflect a need for more robust in-app features. Additionally, it can highlight areas where the BI tool may not fully meet user needs for data analysis and presentation. Understanding this metric helps organizations identify opportunities for enhancing the user experience and improving decision support capabilities.

