Metric:
- id: democratization.dept_coverage
- name: 
- description: This metric quantifies the extent to which Business Intelligence (BI) tools and practices are adopted across various departments within an organization. A high coverage score indicates that multiple departments are actively utilizing BI resources, suggesting a culture of data-driven decision-making throughout the organization. It reflects the inclusivity of BI initiatives, highlighting how well these tools are integrated into the workflows of different teams. By measuring department coverage, organizations can identify areas of strength and pinpoint departments that may require additional support or training to enhance their BI engagement. Ultimately, this metric serves as an indicator of the overall effectiveness of BI democratization efforts within the organization.

